{
  "chapter": "tools/tools-are-apis-for-models",
  "tier": "build",
  "notes": [
    "Meridian already has an API. That API is not a tool surface, and wrapping it is the most",
    "common way to build an agent nobody can fix.",
    "A tool is a job, not an endpoint. If a question always requires three calls in a fixed",
    "order, that chain is one tool — one round trip instead of three, and one payload in the",
    "window instead of three.",
    "The result is context, not a response. Every field the agent did not need is paid for on",
    "every subsequent request, forever.",
    "The description is the interface. It is shipped, it is the routing logic, and it is the",
    "only thing standing between two tools that could both plausibly answer a question.",
    "Arguments come from the model; authority does not. The subject is a legitimate model",
    "decision and the requester is not a decision at all, so it never appears in a schema.",
    "Token counts are per field, so the comparison between the generated surface and the",
    "curated one is exact in both languages."
  ],
  "policy": {
    "identityFields": ["requesterId", "tenantId", "customerId", "userId"],
    "maxLiveTools": 3,
    "minDescriptionWords": 12
  },
  "endpoints": [
    {
      "id": "GET /v2/accounts/{id}",
      "fields": { "tier": 20, "owner": 25, "renewalDate": 15, "addressBlock": 180, "billingCodes": 220, "legacyFlags": 140 }
    },
    {
      "id": "GET /v2/accounts/{id}/contracts",
      "fields": { "contractId": 12, "start": 10, "end": 10, "termsRef": 15, "amendments": 160 }
    },
    {
      "id": "GET /v2/contracts/{id}/terms",
      "fields": { "creditCeiling": 20, "noticeDays": 12, "slaTier": 14, "boilerplate": 400 }
    },
    {
      "id": "GET /v2/accounts/{id}/tickets",
      "fields": { "openCount": 8, "escalatedCount": 8, "oldestDays": 8, "ticketBodies": 900 }
    }
  ],
